{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 105,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O give thanks to the LORD; call upon his name: make known his deeds among the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to him, sing psalms to him: talk ye of all his wondrous works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Glory ye in his holy name: let the heart of them rejoice that seek the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seek the LORD, and his strength: seek his face evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember his wonderful works that he hath done; his wonders, and the judgments of his mouth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O ye seed of Abraham his servant, ye children of Jacob his chosen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD our God: his judgments ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath remembered his covenant for ever, the word ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he commanded to a thousand generations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "covenant",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he made with Abraham, and his oath to Isaac;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And confirmed the same to Jacob for a law, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an everlasting covenant:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying, To thee will I give the land of Canaan, the lot of your inheritance:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they were a few men in number; yes, very few, and strangers in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they went from one nation to another, from ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " kingdom to another people;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He suffered no man to do them wrong: yes, he reproved kings for their sakes;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Touch not my anointed, and do my prophets no harm.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moreover he called for a famine upon the land: he broke the whole staff of bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He sent a man before them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Joseph, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was sold for a servant:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose feet they hurt with fetters: he was laid in iron:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Until the time that his word came: the word of the LORD tried him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king sent and loosed him; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ruler of the people, and let him go free.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He made him lord of his house, and ruler of all his substance:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To bind his princes at his pleasure; and teach his senators wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Israel also came into Egypt; and Jacob sojourned in the land of Ham.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he increased his people greatly; and made them stronger than their enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He turned their heart to hate his people, to deal subtilly with his servants.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He sent Moses his servant; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Aaron whom he had chosen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They showed his signs among them, and wonders in the land of Ham.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He sent darkness, and made it dark; and they rebelled not against his word.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He turned their waters into blood, and slew their fish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their land brought forth frogs in abundance, in the chambers of their kings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He spoke, and there came divers sorts of flies, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lice in all their borders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He gave them hail for rain, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " flaming fire in their land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He smote their vines also and their fig-trees; and broke the trees of their borders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He spoke, and the locusts came, and caterpillars, and that without number,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ate up all the herbs in their land, and devoured the fruit of their ground.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He smote also all the first-born in their land, the chief of all their strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He brought them forth also with silver and gold: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not one feeble ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "person",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among their tribes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Egypt was glad when they departed: for the fear of them fell upon them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He spread a cloud for a covering; and fire to give light in the night.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The people",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " asked, and he brought quails, and satisfied them with the bread of heaven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He opened the rock, and the waters gushed out; they ran in the dry places ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a river.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he remembered his holy promise, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Abraham his servant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought forth his people with joy, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his chosen with gladness:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And gave them the lands of the heathen: and they inherited the labor of the people;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.105.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.105.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That they might observe his statutes, and keep his laws. Praise ye the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
